#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:3
#: 3f6458ac189943d58b837f2294ccd896
msgid ""
"How a new robot enters this stack. Copy an **existing** description "
"package and the launch/xacro patterns already in the repo. Do not invent "
"package trees, `hardware:=mock`, MPC horizon YAML, or a "
"`display.launch.py` that no package README lists."
msgstr ""
"新机器人如何进入本技术栈。复制**已有**描述包以及仓库里已有的 launch/xacro "
"模式。不要编造包目录树、`hardware:=mock`、MPC 时域 YAML，或任何包 README 都没有的 "
"`display.launch.py`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:5
#: 43d2b0381aa4470795efe30d5f96b727
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "权威来源"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:8
#: ff118f7ed24a4369ae67072ac7c8c445
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Description layout: an existing `{robot}_description` package (example "
"below: [arx_acone_description](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-arx/tree/main/arx_acone_description)) and its package README"
msgstr ""
"描述包布局：已有 `{robot}_description` "
"包（下例：[arx_acone_description](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-arx/tree/main/arx_acone_description)）及其包 README"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:9
#: 1d88076b15f1490fb8b92f5bf467fbb7
msgid ""
"Umbrella + submodule paths: [robot_descriptions "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/README.md) (e.g. ARX at "
"`manipulator/ARX`)"
msgstr ""
"伞形仓与子模块路径：[robot_descriptions README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/README.md)（例如 ARX 在 `manipulator/ARX`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:10
#: 623bb34a6e3046528d659c1e827723c5
msgid ""
"Launch / `hardware:=` / EEF: "
"[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)"
msgstr ""
"Launch / `hardware:=` / "
"末端：[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:11
#: 593b37604bd349a5b70938f551c0ddab
msgid ""
"Workspace init: `./init_repo.sh` in [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/README.EN.md) + "
"[`submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf)"
msgstr ""
"工作区初始化：[open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/README.EN.md) 的 `./init_repo.sh` + "
"[`submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:12
#: ae8622e47e66469e81540ee965911aab
msgid ""
"Isaac USD: FaSim-Isaac skill **`isaac-urdf-usda-ocs2`** (folder `USDA-"
"OCS2-PhysX-Mujoco`) — [skill](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/.cursor/skills/USDA-OCS2-PhysX-Mujoco/SKILL.md) — plus "
"`./init.sh` / `./run.sh` and [robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"Isaac USD：FaSim-Isaac skill **`isaac-urdf-usda-ocs2`**（目录 `USDA-OCS2"
"-PhysX-Mujoco`）— [skill](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/.cursor/skills/USDA-OCS2-PhysX-Mujoco/SKILL.md) — 以及 "
"`./init.sh` / `./run.sh` 和 [robot_usds](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:13
#: 7b4c13860c524f178c95bf5c2b1dff63
msgid ""
"Description-side Cursor skills: **`robot_descriptions` branch "
"`feature/agilex`** — [`.cursor/skills/README.md`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md). "
"**`main` has no `.cursor/skills`**. `robot-descriptions-common` and "
"`robot_usds` have none on `main`. Do not invent extra description skills."
msgstr ""
"描述侧 Cursor skill：在 **`robot_descriptions` 的 `feature/agilex` "
"分支** — [`.cursor/skills/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md)。"
"**`main` 没有 `.cursor/skills`**。`robot-descriptions-common` 和 "
"`robot_usds` 在 `main` 上也没有。不要编造额外的描述 skill。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:16
#: 0ee2d5e66e7d4329b792dd29879f5bd7
msgid "1. ROS description package"
msgstr "1. ROS 描述包"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:18
#: 4382a3da5d424461ade8e62847046cd9
msgid ""
"Public brand trees live as submodules under "
"[robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_descriptions) "
"(`common`, `manipulator/ARX`, `manipulator/Dobot`, …). In `open-deploy-"
"ws` the same tree is `src/robot-descriptions/` after "
"**`./init_repo.sh`**. Do not recursive-init."
msgstr ""
"公开品牌树作为子模块挂在 [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions) 下（`common`、`manipulator/ARX`、`manipulator/Dobot` "
"等）。在 `open-deploy-ws` 中，**`./init_repo.sh`** 之后同一棵树是 `src/robot-"
"descriptions/`。不要递归 init。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:20
#: 512de4da08724a6bbbcfb0da65adeb57
msgid "Copy a real package. Acone (from that repo) looks like:"
msgstr "复制真实的包。Acone（该仓库）大致是："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:22
#: 11d733a4505b412cbf8bff352fefc188
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"arx_acone_description/\n"
"├── CMakeLists.txt\n"
"├── package.xml\n"
"├── README.md\n"
"├── xacro/\n"
"│   ├── robot.xacro\n"
"│   ├── arm_mount.xacro\n"
"│   ├── component.xacro\n"
"│   └── ros2_control/          # hardware plugin branches\n"
"├── config/\n"
"│   ├── ocs2/                  # task .info (not an invented "
"ocs2_arm_config.yaml)\n"
"│   └── ros2_control/          # optional {hardware}.yaml overlay\n"
"└── meshes/"
msgstr ""
"arx_acone_description/\n"
"├── CMakeLists.txt\n"
"├── package.xml\n"
"├── README.md\n"
"├── xacro/\n"
"│   ├── robot.xacro\n"
"│   ├── arm_mount.xacro\n"
"│   ├── component.xacro\n"
"│   └── ros2_control/          # hardware plugin branches\n"
"├── config/\n"
"│   ├── ocs2/                  # task .info (not an invented "
"ocs2_arm_config.yaml)\n"
"│   └── ros2_control/          # optional {hardware}.yaml overlay\n"
"└── meshes/"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:38
#: 3d81845f5c984ff98231dbfa8985eb15
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Launch key is `robot:=<key>` where the package is `{key}_description` "
"([robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)). "
"`demo.launch.py` default is `cr5`."
msgstr ""
"启动键是 `robot:=<key>`，对应包名 "
"`{key}_description`（[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)）。`demo.launch.py`"
" 默认是 `cr5`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:40
#: 0401da3c7e404b47a67a806e37d33314
msgid ""
"`hardware:=` values that exist in Acone xacro / common launch: "
"`mock_components` (default), `gz`, `isaac`, `real`. There is **no** "
"`hardware:=mock`. Plugins: [ros2_control in This "
"Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). Do not invent a new HI "
"class name here — use that robot’s `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` or an "
"existing vendor HI README ([arx-ros2-control](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/arx-ros2-control) for ARX `hardware:=real`)."
msgstr ""
"Acone xacro / common launch 中存在的 `hardware:=` "
"取值：`mock_components`（默认）、`gz`、`isaac`、`real`。**没有** `hardware:=mock`。插件见 "
"[本技术栈中的 ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。此处不要编造新的 "
"HI 类名 — 用该机器人的 `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` 或已有厂商 HI README（ARX "
"`hardware:=real` 见 [arx-ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/arx-ros2-control)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:42
#: fdbd30bc2d9f404d8b3426d880d964c0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"OCS2 files the controller actually loads: "
"`{robot_pkg}/config/ocs2/<info>.info` ([ocs2_arm "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md))."
" Planning URDF comes from the same xacro via `robot_common_launch`, not a"
" static `urdf/*.urdf`."
msgstr ""
"控制器实际加载的 OCS2 文件：`{robot_pkg}/config/ocs2/<info>.info`（[ocs2_arm "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)）。规划"
" URDF 由同一套 xacro 经 `robot_common_launch` 生成，不是静态 `urdf/*.urdf`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:44
#: 31c7da2619a24cccb90e10f248684451
msgid "EEF / FT / TCP: `type` / `left_type` / `right_type` (not `gripper:=`)."
msgstr "末端 / 力传感器 / TCP：`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`（不是 `gripper:=`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:46
#: 95cb67b0fe074703ab1f8d06d48cd39e
msgid "Chassis / swerve / `collider:=simple` (`feature/agilex` skill)"
msgstr "底盘 / 舵轮 / `collider:=simple`（`feature/agilex` skill）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:48
#: 3a48d7b829b340a5b6e8fa2e387cf02a
msgid ""
"On **`feature/agilex` only**, the skills index currently lists one skill:"
" **`split-chassis-glb`** ([SKILL.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/split-chassis-"
"glb/SKILL.md)). Canonical example in that skill: "
"`rokae_inex_description`."
msgstr ""
"**仅在 `feature/agilex` 上**，skills 索引目前只列了一个 skill："
" **`split-chassis-glb`**（[SKILL.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/split-chassis-"
"glb/SKILL.md)）。该 skill 的规范示例是 `rokae_inex_description`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:50
#: bd04bdaf7b254f18b88c1770454171d9
msgid ""
"What it does (overview — follow the skill, do not treat this as a "
"substitute):"
msgstr "它做什么（仅概览 — 以 skill 为准，不要把下面当替代文档）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:52
#: 698a01455e9648ec9be12f67815fe261
msgid ""
"Split one assembled chassis GLB into `chassis` / `steer` / `wheel` meshes"
" with joint-ready origins"
msgstr "把一个装配好的底盘 GLB 拆成 `chassis` / `steer` / `wheel` 网格，原点已对齐关节"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:53
#: 2223c2b291d14d349bf1373d80688e7f
msgid ""
"Write swerve xacro (reuse one steer + one wheel at `fl` `fr` `rl` `rr`; "
"right modules yaw 180°, no mesh reflect)"
msgstr ""
"写舵轮 xacro（在 `fl` `fr` `rl` `rr` 复用同一套 steer + wheel；右侧模块 yaw "
"180°，不镜像网格）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:54
#: 30c11534d5a04ebdbe104df0adfac921
msgid ""
"Add `collider:=simple` boxes from **glTF-node** AABBs (not raw accessor "
"min/max)"
msgstr "用 **glTF 节点** AABB 加 `collider:=simple` 盒子（不是 accessor 的原始 min/max）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:56
#: 1b61efa0a50a44f49809a1bfea4915fd
msgid ""
"How to add more skills under `.cursor/skills/`: the same [skills "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md). "
"Package layout and submodule paths still come from the "
"[robot_descriptions README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/README.md) (`main`). Use "
"`feature/agilex` when you need this skill or newer AgileX content; do not"
" assume `main` has the skills directory."
msgstr ""
"如何在 `.cursor/skills/` 下加更多 skill：同一份 [skills "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md)。包布局和子模块路径仍以 "
"[robot_descriptions README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/README.md)（`main`）为准。需要本 skill 或更新的 "
"AgileX 内容时用 `feature/agilex`；不要假设 `main` 已有 skills 目录。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:58
#: 75af88e598c04415a729a5d9279e5403
msgid "2. Wire it into a deploy workspace"
msgstr "2. 接到部署工作区"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:60
#: e31e9b027dad4525967efc7bd13a7fb4
msgid "In `open-deploy-ws`:"
msgstr "在 `open-deploy-ws` 中："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:62
#: d460f844849141f2a7b941696c721433
msgid "`./init_repo.sh` so nested modules match `submodules_visibility.conf`."
msgstr "`./init_repo.sh`，让嵌套模块与 `submodules_visibility.conf` 一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:63
#: da510fa49fb04363b5edcf4851d7f069
msgid ""
"If you added a **new** nested submodule: add the Git submodule on the "
"parent, then one pipe line `parent_dir|relative_path|public` or `private`"
" — [Submodules Visibility](../../3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md)."
msgstr ""
"若新增**嵌套**子模块：先在父仓加 Git submodule，再在 conf 加一行 "
"`parent_dir|relative_path|public` 或 `private` — "
"[子模块可见性](../../3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:64
#: 923a788843bf412daab3d994a6a9031b
msgid ""
"`colcon build --symlink-install`. Lean branches (`arx-lift2s`, `panthera-"
"ht`): prefer **`./quick_start.sh`** (it sources `install/setup.bash` "
"after a successful build). On `main`, after colcon, `source "
"install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal (standard ROS overlay; no "
"extra env script)."
msgstr ""
"`colcon build --symlink-install`。精简分支（`arx-lift2s`、`panthera-ht`）：优先 "
"**`./quick_start.sh`**（构建成功后它会 source `install/setup.bash`）。在 `main` "
"上，colcon 之后在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`（标准 ROS overlay；没有额外环境脚本）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:66
#: f606d9a6e3e048d186c400463798aeb9
msgid ""
"[robot-descriptions-arx README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-arx/blob/main/README.md) also shows adding the brand repo as"
" `src/robot-descriptions-arx` or `git submodule update --init "
"manipulator/ARX` under the umbrella. Prefer the deploy-ws init script "
"when you are in `open-deploy-ws`."
msgstr ""
"[robot-descriptions-arx README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-arx/blob/main/README.md) 也写了把品牌仓加为 `src/robot-descriptions-"
"arx`，或在伞形仓下 `git submodule update --init manipulator/ARX`。在 `open-deploy-"
"ws` 里优先用部署工作区的 init 脚本。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:68
#: 24301dbaac8f4931b4291961c0ac174d
msgid ""
"Controllers already in [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control): `ocs2_arm_controller` `demo.launch.py` / "
"`split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py`, plus "
"`basic_joint_controller`. Example from the Acone README (after the "
"workspace overlay):"
msgstr ""
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) "
"里已有的控制器：`ocs2_arm_controller` 的 `demo.launch.py` / `split_body.launch.py`"
" / `full_body.launch.py`，以及 `basic_joint_controller`。Acone README 示例（工作区 "
"overlay 之后）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:70
#: bbd416a95daa4f63bea3d31dd15e3221
msgid ""
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_acone\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone"
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_acone\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:75
#: 2c85c9df0d3d4b8f8bf02f0344a99368
msgid ""
"Do not invent `robot_description_newrobot/display.launch.py` or a "
"`NewRobotHardwareInterface` C++ stub."
msgstr ""
"不要编造 `robot_description_newrobot/display.launch.py` 或 "
"`NewRobotHardwareInterface` C++ 桩。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:77
#: 0809f2b0a3de4c54af646e59c11a9a7e
